      "document": "Monitoring training load - session RPE and the limits of load ratios",
      "section": "Session RPE training load",
      "text": "Session RPE quantifies internal training load by multiplying the person's rating of perceived exertion for the whole session, on a 0 to 10 scale, by the session duration in minutes. The product, in arbitrary units, can be summed across a week to track load (Foster 2001).",
